rofessor, Simon Judeau, to help him pursue numerous sources of info about the Curse of the Legendary Titans. [TCG:OAL-048]\n\n== Abilities ==\nThresher can move at great speed while covering great distances whether on land or water. This makes him especially useful for pursuing enemies.\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nThresher Icon.png|Thresher's Icon\nThresher.png|Thresher","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox titan\n| image            = File:Thresher.png\n| attack           = 3\n| defense          = 2\n| type             = [[Meso-Titan]]\n| special ability  = Legendary Speed\n| first appearance = [[TCG: OAL-048|OAL-048]]\n| user             = [[The Professor]]\n}}\n'''Thresher''' is a shark-like [[Titan]] used by [[the Professor]]. Much like its [[Draco-Titan]] cousin, [[Land Shark]], it can travel on land as well as under water.\n\n== History ==\nThresher was used by [[the Professor]], Simon Judeau, to help him pursue numerous sources of info about the [[Curse of the Legendary Titans]]. {{source|TCG:OAL-048}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nThresher can move at great speed while covering great distances whether on land or water. This makes him especially useful for pursuing enemies.\n\n{{clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nThresher Icon.png|Thresher's Icon\nThresher.png|Thresher\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Meso-Titans]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{MesoBox}}","categories":["Huntik Foundation Titans","Meso-Titans","Organization Titans","TCG Titans","Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Meso-Titan","label":"Meso-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2834","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Meso-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Meso-Titans"},{"target_title":"TCG:OAL-048","label":"OAL-048","target_id":"huntik:page:7972","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:OAL-048","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A